OC UY QUYEN NEU TREN.\n\nGIAY UY QUYEN NAY CHI CO HIEU LUC TRONG VONG BA (03) THANG KE TU NGAY KY VA CO GIA TRI RANG BUOC DOI VOI\n\nNHUNG NGUOI DAI DIEN CUA CA NHAN TOI, NHUNG NGUOI THUA KE VA/ HOAC QUAN LY DI SAN CUA TOI.\n\nBEN MUA BAO  CHUYEN VIEN TU VAN BAO HIEM DUOC UY  NGUOI LAM  XAC NHAN CUA\n\nHIEM  QUYEN  CHUNG  ADM\n\n(KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)\n\nMOI SUA CHUA TREN GIAY UY QUYEN PHAI CO CHU KY XAC NHAN CUA BEN UY QUYEN\n\nLUU Y: DE NGHI BEN MUA BAO HIEM KY DUNG VOI CHU KY DA DANG KY GIAO DICH VOI CONG TY\n\nPOSF4713", "html": "<p>SO 319 HOANG DIEU, TAN PHONG, 7, TPHCM</p>\n<p>Tel: 0886848884</p>\n<p>www.congtytnhhbaohiemn.vn</p>\n<p>PHONG NGHIEP VU</p>\n<p>CONG TY TNHH BAO HIEM NHAN THO TAN AN</p>\n<h1>GIAY UY QUYEN NHAN TIEN</h1>\n<h2>(CHI AP DUNG CHO TRUONG HOP UY QUYEN CHO CHUYEN VIEN TU VAN BAO HIEM NHAN PHI BAO HIEM HOAN LAI VOI SO TIEN NHO HON</h2>\n<h2>5.000.000 DONG)</h2>\n<p>HO VA TEN (CHU IN HOA) NGO THI HONG NHUNG</p>\n<p>SO CMND 744422524</p>\n<p>NGAY CAP 16/07/2009</p>\n<p>NOI CAP TPHCM</p>\n<p>LA BEN MUA BAO HIEM CUA HOP DONG BAO HIEM/HO SO YEU CAU BAO HIEM SO: 66366902</p>\n<p>HO VA TEN (CHU IN HOA) LE THI KIEU TRINH</p>\n<p>SO CMND 705590520</p>\n<p>NGAY CAP 16/09/2011</p>\n<p>NOI CAP HA NOI</p>\n<p>DIA CHI TAN PHONG - 7 - TPHCM</p>\n<p>MA SO TU VAN 27313932</p>\n<p>DIEN THOAI 0916561596</p>\n<p>BANG SO: 2,728,000</p>\n<p>BANG CHU: HAI TRIEU BAY TRAM HAI MUOI TAM NGHIN DONG</p>\n<p>THEO THONG BAO CUA CONG TY NGAY 03/02/2020</p>\n<p>TOI XAC NHAN RANG TREN CO SO KHI CONG TY THANH TOAN SO TIEN NEU TREN CHO NGUOI DUOC UY QUYEN, CONG</p>\n<p>TY DUOC:</p>\n<p>1) MIEN TRU KHOI MOI KHIEU NAI HAY YEU CAU BOI THUONG CUA TOI DOI VOI CONG TY VE KHOAN THANH TOAN NOI</p>\n<p>TREN.</p>\n<p>2) TOI BOI HOAN VA GIU CHO CONG TY KHONG PHAI CHI TRA BAT KY KHOAN TIEN GI DOI VOI TAT CA CAC YEU CAU,</p>\n<p>KHIEU NAI, NGHIA VU NO, TON THAT, CHI PHI PHAT SINH LIEN QUAN DEN HAY DO VIEC CONG TY THANH TO